# Unification: chapter I reads the creature's owner, not its controller (CR 108.3, 121.1). Bot1 has taken Bot2's Ornithopter
# with Act of Treason, so Bot2 - its owner - draws two and it is shuffled into Bot2's library (CR 701.24a); Bot1, who controls
# it, draws nothing. Chapter II takes the Spacecraft from the graveyard, Entombed there on turn one, with none in hand (CR
# 608.2d).

